// The "who wins" matchup matrix: StarCraft II LotV 5.0.14 benchmarks as data.
//
// Each battle spawns two sides, orders them through PlayerCommand on the first tick, and runs
// until one side is gone or `ticks` elapse. `expect` records survivors as inclusive ranges,
// plus an optional hull range for each side's first unit and, for a claim about one unit's fate,
// whether that unit is alive at the end. Every outcome must hold on every seed. See tests/sc2_who_wins_matchup_matrix_tests.rs, and explain any rebaseline in the
// commit that changes this file.
